Test: FAWK-specific edge cases
--------------------------------------
Test 1: Delete $0 (should be ignored)
  Before: $0 = test line , NF = 2
  After delete $0: $0 = test line , NF = 2

Test 2: Delete negative field
  Before: NF = 3
  After delete $(-1): NF = 3

Test 3: Delete field beyond NF
  Before: NF = 3
  After delete $10: NF = 3

Test 4: Delete all fields one by one
  Initial: NF = 3 , $0 = x y z
  After delete $1: NF = 2 , $0 = y z
  After delete $1 again: NF = 1 , $0 = z
  After delete $1 third time: NF = 0 , $0 = 

Test 5: delarray on non-array variable
  Before: scalar = 42
  After delarray scalar: scalar = 0

